WEBVTT

00:00:00.325 --> 00:00:02.105
I <b>always</b> have breakfast.

00:00:06.036 --> 00:00:08.827
They <b>usually</b> finish work at 5.00.

00:00:12.851 --> 00:00:15.736
She <b>sometimes</b> watches TV in the evening.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:21.405
He <b>never</b> eats meat.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.913
Does she <b>usually</b> go shopping on Saturday?

00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:34.471
What time do you <b>usually</b> get up?